Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) and
[`docs/AGENT_ONBOARDING.md`](../../docs/AGENT_ONBOARDING.md) before editing.
`AGENTS.md` is canonical; this rule is only a pointer.

Quick start: create `.venv`, install `.[dev,gui]`, run
`python scripts/check.py`. Never import or modify `external/`, never commit
private audio/lyrics/model weights/caches, keep GUI logic in `app/`, and update
the roadmap marker in the same change. No invented measurements.
